        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "なんか安心できる歌声だな…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "声のする方向に行ってみよう…ここから出る方法を教えてくれるかも。"
